# Line-ending and binary policy for this repository.
#
# Windows entry points (*.cmd) must be CRLF and ASCII so a double-click works in cmd.exe on
# every Windows version, regardless of the client's core.autocrlf setting. Everything else is
# normalised by git and checked out with LF.
#
# The tests assert this: every *.cmd under the project must be CRLF with no non-ASCII byte.

* text=auto

*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.psm1 text eol=lf
*.cs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# Build output / binaries are never line-ending converted.
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
